  m_text: "Too many of you citizens are sick of if too many die, you lose the game.
    To prevent that, you can build hospitals to cure the sick, but beware that many
    things can increase the sickness level of your citizens:\n* being malnourished\n*
    being neighbours to sick or dead citizens\n* working in the fishing dock\n* the
    winter\u2026"
